<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY ONE-MONTH YIELD RISES TO 19.88 PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY ONE-MONTH YIELD RISES TO 19.88 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of one-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 19.88 percent, up from 19.73 percent at an auction week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	2,251.99 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    19.88 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     98.5507 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
